The `equity-research` and `suitability` skills adapt analytical methodology
(discounted-cash-flow valuation, trading comparables, and fundamental quality
analysis) from the Anthropic "Claude for Financial Services" reference skills:

    anthropics/financial-services
    https://github.com/anthropics/financial-services
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The methodology was re-implemented for this project's skill + deterministic-
primitive architecture and emits structured JSON contracts rather than the
original spreadsheet/document outputs. No source files were copied verbatim.
